msgstr "min"

#. module: homeschool_practice
#: model:homeschool.practice.quest.template,name:homeschool_practice.quest_subject_sessions
msgid "{target} session{s} of {subject}"
msgstr "{target} séance{s} de {subject}"

#. module: homeschool_practice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:homeschool_practice.field_homeschool_student__practice_sessions_max
msgid "… and at most this many (drawn in the range, varied)."
msgstr "… et au plus ce nombre (tiré dans l’intervalle, varié)."

#. module: homeschool_practice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:homeschool_practice.field_homeschool_student__practice_ramp_weeks
msgid ""
"0: the settings apply at once. Else the day's sessions and practice time "
"grow week by week, linearly, from the defaults in week 1 (3 to 5 sessions, "
"no practice-time quest) to the settings, reached in the last week. The "
"number of quests does not change: the quests get bigger."
msgstr ""
"0 : les réglages s’appliquent tout de suite. Sinon les séances et le temps "
"de pratique de la journée grandissent semaine après semaine, linéairement, "
"des valeurs par défaut en semaine 1 (3 à 5 séances, pas de quête de temps de "
"pratique) jusqu’aux réglages, atteints la dernière semaine. Le nombre de "
"quêtes ne change pas : les quêtes grossissent."

#. module: homeschool_practice
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:homeschool_practice.field_homeschool_student__practice_ramp_weeks
msgid "Ramp (weeks)"
msgstr "Montée progressive (semaines)"

#. module: homeschool_practice
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:homeschool_practice.field_homeschool_student__practice_ramp_start
msgid "Ramp from"
msgstr "Début de la montée progressive"

#. module: homeschool_practice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:homeschool_practice.field_homeschool_student__practice_ramp_start
msgid "With a ramp: the day the learner's bigger day starts growing (week 1)."
msgstr ""
"Avec une montée progressive : le jour où la journée de l’élève commence à grandir "
"(semaine 1)."
